[BLAME] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/pretense/dag_engine_lite_impl_pretense.py: The coverage audit identified specification requirements and behavioral aspects lacking test coverage: the node retrieval operation must be verified to raise NodeNotFoundError when the queried identifier is absent from the graph; the node removal operation's downstream reverse-edge cleanup must be tested when a node with incoming dependencies is removed; the graph validation operation must be tested with a node referencing a missing dependency to verify NodeNotFoundError is raised; the graph validation operation must be tested with a cyclic dependency graph to verify CycleError containing the cycle sequence is raised; the topological sort operation must be tested with a cyclic graph to verify CycleError is raised; the critical path computation operation must be tested with an empty graph to verify the empty path result; the DAG runner execution must be tested with an empty wave condition to verify the run loop terminates correctly.
